# Display names that are empty or only blanks, in quotes.  The library
# writes no name, only the blanks that were around it: the From line has
# two blanks before the address, the To line five.  The expected file
# records that, not an endorsement of it.
mode=accept
tls=none
form=(From='"" <alice@example.com>' To='"   " <bob@example.net>' Subject=Hello Body=$'Hi\n' User=alice Password=secret)
